{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/extras/Storepagegif1DEMO_1.gif?t=1749531125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cYou have 24 hours to live.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the first descent in <i>Mayday Trials</i>, a psychological visual novel where every choice bleeds into Sora\u2019s fate. In this free demo, experience the beginning of the story, where reality fractures, memory twists, and the truth is never simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/extras/Storepagegif2_1.gif?t=1749531125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sora\u2014a fragile young man with a chip in his brain and a countdown in his head\u2014awakens in an interrogation room led by the cryptic figure known as Mayday. This short but impactful playable teaser drops you where the story begins: a looping  hallway, a surreal moral dilemma, and the seeds of a shattered past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/extras/Storepagegif4_1.gif?t=1749531125\" /><strong>Demo Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A ~10 Minute Teaser</strong><br>Begin Sora\u2019s journey as he confronts Mayday and the brutal nature of his predicament.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric &amp; Grunge-Inspired Visuals and Soundtrack</strong>\u00a0<br>Grunge visuals and a haunting soundtrack set the tone for the psychological unraveling to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet the Key Voices</strong><br>Experience early character development for both Sora and Mayday, whose dynamic drives the full story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/extras/Storepagegif5_1.gif?t=1749531125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning. <i>Mayday Trials Demo</i> offers a glimpse into a story about free will, inherited trauma.\u00a0<br><br><strong>What is the price of peace, and what is Sora willing to give up for his humanity?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675460?t=1749531125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/8abc3e2c0cb98dcbcd0f9edc135a6871c20b1ee7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749531125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/8a3ae63606f2a6e3737387d04845a260c5d626bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749531125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/8a3ae63606f2a6e3737387d04845a260c5d626bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749531125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Psychological trauma, emotional distress, references to catastrophic events, blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675460/extras/Storepagegif1DEMO_1.gif?t=1749531125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cYou have 24 hours to live.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the first descent in <i>Mayday Trials</i>, a psychological visual novel where every choice bleeds into Sora\u2019s fate. In this free demo, experience the beginning of the story, where reality fractures, memory twists, and the truth is never simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\